      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "description": "CL-01「免费那一半」：Prometheus 已抓取的每个 target 的通断（up）。\n覆盖 6 应用服务 + APISIX + OAP + llm-service + obs 自身。\n**不含**未被抓取的容器（postgres/redis/kafka broker/minio/nacos/etcd/promtail、ai profile 模型容器）——\n那部分需 cAdvisor（CL-01 §7 D-02，暂缓）。"
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Down Targets（up==0）",
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 10,
        "x": 14,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(up == 0) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "description": "`or vector(0)` 保证「零 down」时仍返回 1 个 series（0）—— 否则面板会显示 No data，\n用户无法区分「没有 target 挂」与「面板坏了」（E2E-22 实测坑，见 smoke_observability.py 注释）。"
    },
    {
